 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? There's usually a pump for you. Fill it up at the sink, and don't leave it in the dish when you pack up. Yes, even with eco soap. The soapy water can still clog the toilet, so don't flush it. Please don't. Bury them a little off the path so they' out of the way, and give a little distance from any food buries. You'll do. And if the water gets too dirty, just fill a fresh one at the sink.",
